---
import { url } from '../utils/urls';
---

<section class="research-feature" aria-labelledby="paper-heading">
  <div class="paper-cover" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="meta">Paper / 2017</span>
    <span class="paper-glyph">
      Q · Kᵀ
      <br />
      <i>√d</i>
    </span>
    <span class="meta">Attention is all you need</span>
  </div>
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow">Foundational paper / Explained</p>
    <h2 id="paper-heading">Attention Is All You Need</h2>
    <p class="muted paper-authors">
      Ashish Vaswani, Noam Shazeer, Niki Parmar, Jakob Uszkoreit, Llion Jones,
      Aidan N. Gomez, Łukasz Kaiser, and Illia Polosukhin · 2017 ·
      arXiv:1706.03762
    </p>
    <h3 class="paper-explanation">Attention changed how information moves.</h3>
    <p>
      Start with the mechanism: how attention lets a token gather information
      from other positions. Then follow the architectural decisions into a
      working system.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a
        class="button primary"
        href={url('articles/attention-paper-to-product/')}
      >
        Read the explanation ↗
      </a>
      <a class="text-link" href="https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.03762">
        Original paper ↗
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
